WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.300
Mom: What's your idea, Sam?

2
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.100
Sam: Grandpa's birthday is coming.

3
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.480
Sam: Let's have a surprise party!

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Mom: Oh! That is a great idea!

5
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.279
Mom: Let's see. We can invite the Doyles and—

6
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.600
Sam: Don't forget Lucky!

7
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.939
Mom: I won't. He's one of Grandpa's best friends!

8
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:40.760
Grandma Ruby: Who's one of Grandpa's best friends?

9
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.580
Sam: Lucky. Grandma Ruby, guess what?

10
00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:48.840
Sam: We're having a surprise party for Grandpa!

11
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.920
Grandma Ruby: Great idea! Who thought of it?

12
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.280
Sam: Me.

13
00:00:56.170 --> 00:01:00.110
Mom: Let's make a list. We need snacks, cake . . .

14
00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:04.230
Grandma Ruby: Ice cream . . . balloons . . .

15
00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:12.439
Sam: Don't forget presents! He's turning seventy!

16
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.980
Grandma Ruby: Right. It's a big birthday—

17
00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.700
Grandpa Bill: What's going on?

18
00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:25.290
Grandpa Bill: Do you three have a secret?

19
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.761
Sam: Us? No! I mean—

20
00:01:28.762 --> 00:01:31.614
Lilly: Oooo!

21
00:01:31.614 --> 00:01:35.814
Lilly: Mmm-mmm-mmm . . .

22
00:01:35.814 --> 00:01:41.482
Grandpa Bill: Lilly! No, honey!

23
00:01:41.482 --> 00:01:46.865
Sam: Whew!
